{"job_id":"F-a83c15db562e3616d861","family_id":"F-a83c15db562e3616d861","title":"인천광역시 서구 명칭 변경에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015137-286453-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":21,"target_id":"5971165ccfa77c9509979650a05878c30e118beb1aa73decaa792a34410facf3","source_hash":"3d212538c4167df8aa076e8679910425906e42a3809db3b9714be1107061f496","text":"关于仁川广域市西区名称变更的法令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015137-286453-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":33,"target_id":"953dc4e075ea77bc63ddf22bad5d20bf9f2bf240d44f8bac9299c22f0c2a8cbe","source_hash":"8dd945a67b65e37b072ddac2cb24796a92301026fcae6c186d0fbd9f8effaf81","text":"仁川广域市“西区”将改为“西海区”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015137-286453-ko","scope":"BODY","start":33,"end":56,"target_id":"ce0eeee7bc30d22115a9657cb5da19c84c653d2b7629bee5115679a5011ed0e3","source_hash":"692c23907ae82343fa4e94d68af00f390e79c677b4c46962e5d61f57095c3343","text":"补充规定 <第21734号，​​2026年6月2日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015137-286453-ko","scope":"BODY","start":56,"end":123,"target_id":"786aaaad66fa2d3d7579aaa9214a1cf261a908c9ee251a2b219578788be1bf2c","source_hash":"1092c9e7ed6bc9d3bd717ff3a000fc1abbf6b598d61c39bb8379c328eea36efa","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2026年7月1日起生效。但附录第二条自2028年3月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015137-286453-ko","scope":"BODY","start":123,"end":237,"target_id":"9312793a35cc1861ee3364603e310cc74f49f011bb9a6e89c469bc562e516971","source_hash":"6d2c2addb88dfca076622f5415df393e26e9b27d7a2fda8f92cab3cff19159ab","text":"第2条（修改其他法律）第20605号法律《各级法院的设立和管辖区域法》的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在附表 3 中仁川地方法院北部分院的管辖区域一栏中，“西区”应改为“西海区”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015137-286453-ko","scope":"BODY","start":237,"end":335,"target_id":"105b927c848f91f5da2c8e48137cb8127ef4f19a093368ce407749bee06d1602","source_hash":"8e5a8319dae3f7e9f9edb0267e7169e95fe7d00cbc6e2ac589fe056f5c417c75","text":"第三条（与其他法律的关系）  如果在本法实施时，其他法律中提及的“仁川广域市西区”已根据本法变更名称，则根据本法，该等提及的“仁川广域市西区”应视为“西海区”。"}]}